    "All 24 failed fields omit or reorder the complete two-word color; failure at its second color reference slot is vocabulary-gate collapse in 20 and color-pointer ordering in 4. Stored attention is descriptive evidence, not a controlled causal ablation.",
    "Only two heldout source-copy slots lack global kind/style/output-slot/role/within-role-position TRAIN support, both the two-word-name+two-word-color daypack title. The other 22 failed fields already have seven positive TRAIN rows for the second-color role at their respective output slot.",
